  "name": "Zegas bodycam reshade",
  "slug": "zegas-bodycam-reshade",
  "teaser": "a realistic bodycam reshade for cinematic fights and lighting a wip ",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/ylXK4Ls0rHRVQIpr5zYLmmapuFRrHcQ9a13PjAat.jpg",
  "downloads": 2720,
  "favourites_count": 2,
  "description": "<p>this reshade aims to add something new in spt for those who want a new reshade feeling and lighting inspired by real bodycams here some photos <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/617PGGx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/617PGGx</a>\ninstallation/\n1 )install reshade here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://reshade.me/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://reshade.me/</a>\n2) install my reshade preset\n3) put my reshade in spt folder DO NOT put it in escape from tarkov exe or user or blphenx folders\n4 )run reshade\ncheck all reshade presets\n5) download all presets\n6) start the game\n7) click home button on keyboard\n8) in reshades preset selector look for BODYCAM INI\n9) select it and Enjoy!!!\n(TIP) turn of stamina and health icons for a better experience</p>\n<p>if you’d like to help me with the motivation and development of this reshade you can here <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/zegabooter\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/zegabooter</a></p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2328/zegas-bodycam-reshade",
