      "description": "<p>This works for all SPT version</p>\n<p>this update fixes/adds</p>\n<ul>\n<li>fixes lighting</li>\n<li>fixes lens flare</li>\n<li>fixes performance gain no longer tanking fps i lose maybe 5fps at MAX</li>\n<li>adds eye adaptation\n-adds better visual quality no longer a dramatic mess</li>\n<li>fixes bodycam vignette effect\nheres some screenshots <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/617PGGx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/617PGGx</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
