              "id": 11618,
              "hub_id": 15020,
              "version": "1.6.1",
              "description": "<h3><strong>SPT Realism Mod v1.6.1 for SPT 3.11</strong></h3>\n<p>Note: please see the “known issues” section at the bottom of this post before reporting issues.</p>\n<p>A huge thanks to everyone who helped with testing and gave feedback. It would have taken much longer without you</p>\n<p><strong>Changes</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Trooper Mask</strong>: Trooper mask now has a visual overlay for immersion. Massive thanks to Borkel who temporarily came out of retirement to make this.</li>\n<li><strong>Recoil Tweaks</strong>: made bolt actions more punchy, made MPX more shaky.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Fixes</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed some new ammo not having updated stats.</li>\n<li>Fixed disabling “gear blocks consumption” not actually disabling the feature.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Known Issues:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Balancing is always on-going.</li>\n<li>Continuous healing is not compatible with the medical system, recommended to disable it.</li>\n<li>Using limb selector to heal (hotkey + scroll) can cause strange animation issues and potentially bugs.</li>\n<li>Glock 18C recoil is bugged, BSG issue.</li>\n<li>High ready sprint animation bugs out sometimes, BSG issue (haven’t seen it happen in 3.11 yet).</li>\n<li>Can hit self with melee in the legs.</li>\n<li>SPT/EFT is cursed.</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/416/spt-realism-mod/1.6.1",
              "content_length": null,
              "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0",
